(THG2-01: `Print p.` walks the fields in DEFINITION order - not alphabetical
 order - and recurses into the things they hold, rendering map-style.
 The field lists here are deliberately reverse-alphabetical so definition
 order is distinguishable from any sorting.
 Also covers: THG2-04 in part.
